The desk merged reports with similar subjects. To route a new report, look up the tenant’s locale and booking form, then check which channel received the date. Intake tags describe the browser’s initial guess.

## Engineering disposition · October 5

[Shared parser, issue 1](https://github.com/correasebastian/mega-what-it-shows/issues/1). Engineering fixed DD/MM parsing for EU locales. The shared parser previously read a day-first date as month first. Report R-41200 describes an April 7 reminder sent on July 4.

[Booking-v3 hint, issue 2](https://github.com/correasebastian/mega-what-it-shows/issues/2). Engineering retired the booking-v3 form and closed the hint issue as won’t fix. The form showed MM/DD/YYYY to day-first tenants and interpreted the entry in local order. Report R-41230 came through that form and received a parser tag at intake.

## Report counts

